GamePKG selector for the pinned OpenCE engine. No OpenCE source and no Halo game data are included.

OpenCE itself is AGPL-3.0-or-later. `gamepkg build` clones
https://github.com/OpenCommunityEdition/OpenCE at the commit recorded in
`../tools/opence-pin.json`, outside this package, and checks the license digest.
`tools/opence_checkout.py` uses that same pin.

Halo: Combat Evolved maps, Xbox disc images, and Custom Edition cache files
are not licensed for redistribution. The host refuses a checkout that contains
them and does not pack them into this recipe.

The text of this selector is Apache-2.0. See `LICENSE`. The thumbnail is an
original geometric mark, not Halo artwork.
